h2.text-xl.font-semibold.mb-4 Новый пароль
= form_with url: password_reset_path, method: :patch, class: 'space-y-5', data: { controller: 'fragment-token', turbo: false } do |f|
  = f.hidden_field :token, value: params[:token], data: { fragment_token_target: 'token' }
  p.text-gray-600 data-fragment-token-target="status" Задайте пароль не короче 8 символов.
  = f.label :password, 'Новый пароль', class: 'block font-medium'
  = f.password_field :password, required: true, minlength: 8, autocomplete: 'new-password', class: 'w-full border rounded-lg px-3 py-2'
  = f.label :password_confirmation, 'Повторите пароль', class: 'block font-medium'
  = f.password_field :password_confirmation, required: true, minlength: 8, autocomplete: 'new-password', class: 'w-full border rounded-lg px-3 py-2'
  = f.submit 'Изменить пароль', class: 'w-full bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 cursor-pointer'
